<title>UK: TABLE-Scapa year profit at top of forecasts.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Scapa year profit at top of forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		19.0		   vs 17.7</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 5.28		   vs 4.89</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 7.20		   vs 6.68</p>
<p> Pretax		     66.5		   vs 62.3</p>
<p> Turnover		   526.8		  vs 525.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 65.0 and 66.0 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Scapa Group Plc. -London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
